{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出楞嚴經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六塵者色塵聲塵香塵味塵觸塵法塵也六根者眼根耳根鼻根舌根身根意\n根也六識者眼識耳識鼻識舌識身識意識也七大者地大火大水大風大空大見\n大識大也梵語阿難華言慶喜文殊梵語具云文殊師利華言妙德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語憍陳那華言已知四諦者苦諦集諦滅諦道諦也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語優波尼沙陀華言塵性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語比丘華言乞士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刼梵語具云刼波華言分別時節"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語䟦陀婆羅\n華言賢守"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語摩訶迦葉華言大飲光滅盡定者謂受想心滅出入息盡\n\n而證此定也諸漏者謂由一切煩惱漏落生死也從憍陳那至迦葉是於六塵悟入圓通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語阿那律華言無貧梵語三昧華言正受亦\n云正定三千者大千中千小千也旋見循元者旋大千之見循真性之元也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語周利槃特迦華言繼道梵\n語伽陀華言諷頌數息者息即鼻中氣息謂從一至十漸漸而數也梵語剎那華言\n一念反息循空者反背妄根循依真空也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音詩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語憍梵鉢提華言牛呞以其宿世曾作牛王餘習\n未除故食後常虛噍也梵語沙門華言勤息還味旋知者謂不著塵味不隨妄知也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語畢陵伽婆蹉華言餘習純覺遺身者謂覺心純\n淨而遺失妄身也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語須菩提華言空生寶明空海者即如來所證明\n妙之理無礙深廣也非所非盡旋法歸無者謂能非之心所非之相悉盡無餘而轉\n諸法塵皆歸寂滅也從阿那律至須菩提是於五根悟入圓通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語舍利弗華言身子心見發光光極知見者由心見發明而圓照萬法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語孫陀羅難陀華言好愛歡\n喜漏盡者生死之漏斷滅也明圓滅漏者真性明了圓融滅諸有漏也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語富樓那󳇐多羅尼華言滿慈是\n其父母名因以稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語優波離華言上首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語目乾連華言綵菽氏旋湛謂旋復澄湛之\n性也從人利弗至目乾連是於六識悟入圓通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語烏芻瑟摩華言火頭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語毘舍\n浮華言遍一切自在如來藏者即一切眾生本具真如之理藏也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無生\n忍者謂一切諸法本來不生於此法中能忍可印證也梵語菩提華言道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語三摩地華言等持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虛空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語彌勒華言慈氏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從烏芻瑟摩至勢至是於七大悟入圓通"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聞思修即三慧也梵語三摩提即三摩地也入流亡所者不隨聲塵頓入\n法流而亡其所入也三十二應者佛應獨覺應緣覺應聲聞應梵王應帝釋應自在\n天應大自在天應天大將軍應天王應四天王太子應人王應長者應居士應宰官\n應婆羅門應比丘應比丘尼應優婆塞應優婆夷應女主應童男應童女應諸天應\n龍應藥叉應乾闥婆應阿修羅應緊那羅應摩呼羅伽應人應非人應也十四無畏\n者一不自觀音以觀觀者二知見施復三觀聽旋復四斷滅妄想心無殺害五熏聞\n成聞六根消復同於聲聽六聞熏精明明徧法界七音性圓消觀聽返入八滅音圓\n聞徧生慈力九熏聞離塵色不能刼十純音無塵根境圓融十一消塵旋明十二融\n\n形復聞十三六根圓通明照無二十四我一名與六十二恒河沙名等無有異也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出法苑珠林"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六情即眼耳鼻舌身意六根也\n五藏者心肝脾肺腎也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凶注者謂陰司注寫凶惡之事也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出天台四教儀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六道者即天道人道修羅道餓鬼道畜生道地獄道也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語弗于逮華言勝梵語瞿耶尼華言牛\n貨梵語閻浮提華言勝金洲梵語欝單越華言勝處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語忉利華言三十三梵語夜摩亦云須𦦨摩\n華言善時分梵語兜率華言知足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三千者小千中千大\n千也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第三果即\n聲聞阿那含果也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出法華玄義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重垢即惡業報處即地獄也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語忉利華言三十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雙空者謂見思二惑俱空也雙假者謂見\n假思假即見思惑以此惑體虛假不實故也雙中者謂破見思惑同入中道也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三諦者真諦俗諦中諦也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語涅槃華言滅度一期者從生至死也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色籠者謂色界色質籠罩\n也空假中即三觀也離性離相之謂空無法不備之謂假非空非假之謂中也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出華嚴經隨䟽演義鈔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語迦毘羅華言黃色刼梵語具云刼波華言分別時節"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第八識即藏識\n也梵語涅槃華言滅度"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出天台四教儀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五欲者色欲聲欲香欲味欲觸欲也五塵者色塵聲塵香\n塵味塵觸塵也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語尸棄華言火三千者大千中千小千也言三千大千者摠別雙舉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一期者謂從生至死也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出法苑珠林"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語娑婆華言能忍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剎利梵語具云剎帝利華言田主即王種也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語乾闥婆華言香陰即帝釋\n\n樂神也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出翻譯名義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出法界次第"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奩力塩切奩底者即盒底也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語瑠璃華言青色寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "腨時兖切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "窊烏𤓰切不滿皃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傴委羽切\n不伸也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語兜羅綿華言細香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二乘者聲聞乘\n緣覺乘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出楞嚴經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刼梵語具云刼波華言分別時節聲教熏習故曰聞熏聞而復修故曰聞修\n金剛有堅利之能以喻三昧之力也梵語三昧華言正定"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語三摩地華\n言等持進修無漏勝觧現圓謂修無為之法即趣入三摩地得無漏勝觧究竟圓成也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有學者有所學也謂第三阿那含果已前俱属有學勝妙現圓者能妙萬物以\n明自性究竟圓成也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二因緣者一無明二行三識\n四名色五六入六觸七受八愛九取十有十一生十二老死也緣斷勝性者謂觀因\n緣得斷煩惱而證勝妙之性也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "得四諦空者謂觀苦集滅道四諦證\n真空理也修道入滅勝性現圓者謂從三果入滅將登第四無學果位勝妙之性現\n前圓成也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語忉利華言三十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名言\n者名教典雅之言也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "數術者呪禁筭藝調\n\n養方法之類是也攝衛者收攝其心衛護身口也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五戒不殺不盜不邪滛不妄語不飲酒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倫類也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "樂人修人者謂愛樂人身而修人之行也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出天台四教儀集註"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三藏教者即經律論三藏也扶惑潤生者謂此教菩薩雖\n已離見思之惑為欲化度眾生故伏惑不斷而示同三思生死也六度者一布施二\n持戒三忍辱四精進五禪定六智慧也梵語菩提華言道菩提樹者以佛於樹下成\n道故也見思者謂意根對法塵起諸分別曰見眼等五根對色等五塵起諸貪愛曰\n忍習氣者謂見思惑之餘習氣分也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "思惑言九品者謂因此惑難斷遂分上中下之三品於三品中又各分三品共\n九品也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出華嚴經隨䟽演義鈔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尺支切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音方"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出法界次第"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三界者欲界色界無色界也見思惑者分別曰見惑貪愛曰思惑也真無\n漏者謂阿羅漢斷見思惑盡不漏落三界生死異於初果等故名真也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出華嚴經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語般若波羅蜜華言智慧到彼岸謂到涅槃彼岸也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普輪者普即普徧之義輪有摧碾之用言此字門能摧碾一切差別之法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輕呼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婆蒲我切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛\n塲即金剛心等覺菩薩位也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "茶徒觧切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙失我切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六根者眼根耳根鼻根舌根身根意根也\n皆自在者如眼根任運觀色自在無礙五根隨用亦復如是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "哆丁\n可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "也以可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "娑蘇我切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "他他可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無翻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奢尸荷切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蠲除也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婆蒲餓切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "娑蘇統切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "縒七可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拏󳏣可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "娑蘇紇切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五眾者即色受想行識謂此五法眾共相生而成身也亦名五\n陰又名五蘊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "也夷可切娑蘇可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無翻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "侘恥可切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出大彌陀經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語\n阿彌陀華言無量壽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七寶者金銀瑠琉玻𬎙硨磲碼瑙赤真珠也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刼梵語具\n云刼波華言分別時節"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漏盡謂生死之漏盡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語般泥\n洹即般涅槃華言滅度"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語那由他華言萬億"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語波羅蜜華言到彼岸六波羅蜜即布施持戒忍辱精進禪\n定智慧不退轉地者謂行與位皆不退也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五逆者殺\n父殺母殺阿羅漢出佛身血破和合僧也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五体者頭及兩手兩足也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語那羅延華言金剛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語由旬華言限量或四十里或六十里\n\n或八十里"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語三昧華言正定"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普等者謂於一\n切法皆平等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三忍即忍位中上忍中忍下忍也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出華嚴經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七寶者金銀瑠璃玻𥠖硨磲碼瑙赤真珠也梵語文殊師利華言妙德梵語娑\n羅華言堅固梵語阿耨多羅三藐三菩提華言無上正等正覺梵語比丘華言乞士\n梵語三昧華言正定"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語菩提華言道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語楞伽華言不可徃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語達里鼻茶華言消融梵語陀羅尼華\n言總持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語閻浮提華言勝金洲梵語般若華言智慧梵語波羅蜜華言到\n彼岸梵語優婆夷華言清淨女"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "毘目瞿沙梵語具云毘多羅涅瞿沙\n華言最上無恐怖聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語那羅素華言不懶惰梵語婆羅門華言淨行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語伊沙那華\n言長直"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無生忍者\n謂一切法本來不生於此法中而能忍可即證也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音育賚也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語優鉢羅華言青蓮華梵語婆施羅華言自在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剎梵語具云剎摩華言土田"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語輸那華言勇猛梵語迦陵迦華言相闘戰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語鞞瑟胝羅華言纏裹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語涅槃華言滅度三世者過去現在未來也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語補怛洛迦華言海島又云小白花"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語墯羅鉢底華言有門梵語釋提桓因華言能入主言帝釋者華梵雙舉也\n梵語阿修羅華言無端正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語摩竭提華言善\n勝梵語婆珊婆演底華言春主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語迦毘羅華言黃色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸趣身即六道等趣之身也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語嵐毘尼華言樂勝圓光刼梵語具云刼波華言分別\n時節梵語釋迦華言能仁梵語瞿波華言女"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "摩耶梵語具云摩訶摩耶華言大術"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語羅剎華言速疾鬼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十二字母者一阿\n字二多字三波字四者字五那字六邏字七柁字八婆字九茶字十沙字十一嚩字\n十二哆字十三也字十四瑟吒字十五迦字十六娑字十七麼字十八伽字十九他\n字二十社字二十一鎖字二十二䭾字二十三奢字二十四佉字二十五义字二十\n六婆多字二十七壤字二十八曷攞多字二十九婆字三十車字三十一娑麼字三\n十二訶婆字三十三縒字三十四伽字三十五吒字三十六拏字三十七娑頗字三\n十八娑迦字三十九也娑字四十室者字四十一佗字四十二陀字也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語彌勒華言慈氏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語毘盧遮那華言徧一切處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語蘇摩那華言恱意梵語由旬華言限量梵語阿僧祇華言無數"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出大涅槃經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四種見者謂於五陰中如計色大我小我在色中為一見\n我即神我謂識神也又計我大色小色在我中為二見又計離色是我為三見又計\n即色是我為四見也色陰既爾受想行識亦然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出不思議秘密大乘經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "帝釋梵語釋提桓因華言能入主言\n帝釋者華梵雙舉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外魔者外\n道天魔也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魔即魔王\n梵即梵天梵語沙門華言勤息梵語婆羅門華言淨行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三千者小千中千大千也言三千大千者總別兼舉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出圓覺經䟽鈔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法處即意識所取之境具有四\n分一心所法二不相應法三無為四無表色今言法處所攝一分者正是無表色也\n\n無表色者謂意識緣於過去所見之境雖分別明了而無所表對故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此專言意\n識者蓋小乘之人唯知心王是第六意識而不知有第七第八二種之識也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "領納前境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於境取像也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起心造作\n諸業也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "希望樂境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "揀擇善惡法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記憶不忘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能警覺者為性心來起能警令起心已起\n能引趣境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於理明了無礙也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語三摩\n\n地華言等持離沉掉曰等令心專注不散曰持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於善法深樂不疑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於諸善法精進修習也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遠離\n掉舉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恥己無德也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羞為惡行也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於五\n欲境心生厭離也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於違情之境不起忿怒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於諸\n有情不加󰡷惱也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遠離昏亂也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於不善法\n心不染著也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無漏者不漏落三界\n生死也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於事理迷惑不了也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "縱恣欲境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身心不勤也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "邪見多疑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心神迷惑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內心搖動也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不知羞恥也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陰為不善也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "暴怒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不令人知己過也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於一切財\n不能惠施也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心懷妬忌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外境違情不自安忍也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󰡷惱有情也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "怨恨也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "媚恱入意也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詭詐\n不實也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矜己傲他也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作\n\n惡事或不作善事心皆追悔也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂人睡眠神識昏昧夢中見境或善\n或惡或不善不惡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尋即尋思即心中所起之念或善或惡或不善不惡\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伺即伺察亦心中所起之念也心麄而浮曰尋心細而沉曰伺二者\n皆是心念但分麄細耳亦通善惡不善不惡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引取無厭也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忿怒不息也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自恃陵他也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "猶豫不決也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無記\n者謂不善不惡無所記錄故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於一\n切決造作成就也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於一切法不能成就也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如人之類其形相似也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即無想報外道修無想定命\n終生無想天以其果報異世成熟故曰異熟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外道所修之定\n\n想心俱滅故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "得此定者受想之心滅盡諸識不起也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第八藏識種子并出入息煖氣三者連持不斷也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法生起\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法未遷也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法漸衰也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法消盡\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依事立名眾名聯合故曰名身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "積言\n成句眾句聮合故曰句身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文即文字眾字聯合故曰文身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "擇即揀擇滅即斷滅以智滅惑所顯真理理無作為\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不假智力斷滅諸惑性本清淨無所作為也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真空之理離諸障礙猶如虛空無所作為也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出華嚴經隨䟽演義鈔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "踝胡\n瓦切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "窊烏𤓰切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語頻婆華言相思"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語那羅延華言金剛謂堅固也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慴質涉切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出天台四教儀集註"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三界思惑分九品者以此惑難斷故細分之令二果斷陁含三果阿那含\n四果阿羅漢次第斷除也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出天台四教儀集註"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "集滅二諦各除身見邊見戒取者謂此三使皆依苦諦而起而此二諦則無也\n道諦除身見邊見者謂此二使亦苦諦所起而此則無也然不除戒取者謂外道執\n取邪戒妄為正道故於此不除也上二界除瞋使者以上二界無瞋故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出天台四教儀集註"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出大乘百法明門論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法處即意識所取之境具有四分一心所法二不相應行三無為四\n無表色今言法處所攝一分者正是無表色也無表色者謂意識緣於過去所見之\n境雖分別明了而無所表對故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語末那華言意梵語阿賴耶華言藏識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能警覺者為性心未起能警令起心已起能引趣境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對境\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "領納前境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於境取像也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起心造諸業也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "希望樂境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於理明了無礙也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於曾習境記憶不忘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離昏沉掉舉曰等令心專注不散曰持也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "揀擇善惡法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於諸善法深樂不疑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恥己無德也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羞為惡行也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於五欲境心生厭離也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於違情之境不起怒心也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於事理明解决了也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於諸善法精勤修習也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遠離昏亂也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於不善法心不染著也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遠離掉舉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於有\n情不加󰡷惱也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引取無厭也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忿怒不息也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自恃陵他也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於事理無所明了也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即邪見也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "猶豫不決也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "暴怒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "怨恨也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不令人知己過也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外境違情不自安隱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心懷妬忌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於一切財不能惠施也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詭詐不實\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "媚恱人意也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󰡷惱有情也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矜己傲人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不知羞恥也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陰為不善也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內心搖動也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心神迷惑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "邪見多疑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身心不勤也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "縱恣欲境\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遺失正念也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心常放逸也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以妄為真也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或已作惡事因循或不作善事心皆追悔也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂人睡眠\n識神昏昧夢中見境或善或惡或不善不惡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尋即尋思心中所起之念\n或善或惡或不善不惡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伺即伺察心中所起之念也尋思之心麄而浮\n伺察之心沉而細二者皆是心念但分麄細耳亦通善惡與不善不惡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無記者謂不善不惡無所記錄故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於一切法造作成就也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第八識種子并出入息煖氣三\n者連持不斷也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如人之類其形相似也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾生之妄性不同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心想俱滅外道所修之定也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受想之心滅盡諸識不起也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外道修無想定命終\n生無想天壽命五百劫想心不行如冰夾魚也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依事立名眾名聯合\n曰名身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "積言成句眾句聯合曰句身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文即是字\n\n眾字聯合曰文身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法生起也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法未遷也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法漸衰也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今有後無也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因果相續流轉不斷也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善惡因果決定不同也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因果和合不相違背也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法遷流不暫停住\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "編列有序也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即時節也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即方所也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即數目也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不相乖違\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "互相乖違也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真空之理離諸障礙猶如虛空無所作為也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "擇即揀擇\n\n滅即斷滅以智滅惑所顯真理理無作為也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不假\n智力斷滅諸惑性本清淨無所作為也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即第四禪天得\n不動地所修出世之理無所作為也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受想心滅所顯\n真理無所作為也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不妄曰真不異曰如真如之理無所\n作為也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出大智度論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語涅槃華言滅度"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三乘者聲聞乘緣覺\n乘菩薩乘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三界者欲界色界無色界也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心即心王心數法即受想行法也不行者謂皆諸法皆不起也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語阿僧\n祇劫華言無數時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語阿鞞\n䟦致華言不退轉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語般若華言\n智慧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結使者謂一切眾生為惑業纏縛驅役入\n於生死也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語須彌華言妙高"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七寶者金銀琉璃玻瓈硨磲碼碯赤真珠也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苦者謂觀五陰\n之身實有生死逼迫等苦也空者謂身及諸法本來皆空也無常者謂身及諸法終\n歸壞滅也無我者謂四大各離何者是我也不淨者謂觀身相皆不淨也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法山之頂以喻此三昧在諸三昧之上也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三毒者貪瞋癡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六塵者色\n塵聲塵香塵味塵觸塵法塵也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無漏者謂惑業已斷不漏落生死也七覺者念覺擇法覺精進覺喜覺輕\n安覺定覺捨覺也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "劫梵語具云劫波華言分別時節"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無等等者\n謂諸佛般若世無與等而一切眾生平等共有故曰無等等梵語般若波羅蜜華言\n智慧到彼岸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三解脫門者空解脫門無相解脫門無作解脫門也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有漏者謂因煩惱惑業漏落三界生死也\n有為者世間法也無為者出世間法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三有者欲\n有色有無色有即三界也底者即非有想非無想天以其難到故名底也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十二相者足安平相千輻輪\n相手指纖長相手足柔軟相手足縵網相足跟滿足相足趺高好相腨如鹿王相手\n過膝相馬陰藏相身縱廣相毛孔生青色相身毛上靡相身金色相身光面各一丈\n相皮膚細滑相七處平滿相兩腋滿相身如師子相身端直相肩圓滿相四十齒相\n齒白齊密相四牙白淨相頰車如師子相咽中津液得上味相廣長舌相梵音深遠\n相眼色如金精相眼睫如牛王相眉間白毫相頂肉髻成相也總相者諸法和合為\n一相也別相者諸法種種差別也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聞持者陀\n\n羅尼名也謂得此陀羅尼者一切語言諸法耳所聞者皆不忘失也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五眾者即色受想行識五陰也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非世間者出世間之法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出佛本行集經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "護明菩薩即釋\n迦牟尼佛在天宮之號也梵語兜率華言知足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三業清淨者謂身不殺不盜不󵖶也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四惡者妄言綺語兩舌惡口也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三毒者貪嗔癡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五欲者色欲聲欲香\n欲味欲觸欲也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三界\n\n者欲界色界無色界也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三歸者歸依佛歸依法歸依僧也三惡道\n者餓鬼道畜生道地獄道也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呰與訾同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一義者謂中道之\n理無二無別也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名即心色\n即身也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸大者即地大水大火大風大空大根大\n識大也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸入者即眼入耳入\n鼻入舌入身入意入色入聲入香入味入觸入法入也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無生忍者謂一切法本來不生於此法中而能忍可\n即證也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "身念處者\n身即五陰中色陰念即能觀之觀處即色陰所觀之境也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受即領納之義謂眼等識領納色等諸境\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "心即五陰\n中識陰也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法即五陰\n中想行二陰也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四正勤者一已生惡令斷二未生惡令不生三已生善念增長四未生善\n令生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四如意足\n者欲如意足念如意足精進如意足慧如意足也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信者謂信正觀及助道法則能生諸善法也根即能生之\n義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "精進者謂修行\n正助之法勤求不息也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念者謂專念正助之法而無他念也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "定者謂攝心在正助之法相應不散也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧者謂以智慧觀察苦集滅道四諦之法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信力者力即力用謂信根增長則能遮斷\n一切疑惑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "精進力者\n謂精進根增長則能破諸身心懈怠也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念力者謂念根增長則能破諸邪念也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "定力者謂定根增長則能破諸亂想也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧力者謂慧根增長則能遮止三界見思之惑\n也二邊者空有二邊也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念覺分者念即想念覺即覺了分即支分謂修出世道時善能覺了常使定慧\n之法均調也若心沉時當念用擇法精進喜三支属慧故也若心浮時當念用除捨\n定三支属定故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "擇法覺分者謂觀諸法善能揀別真偽也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "精進覺分者謂修諸道法時善能覺了勤心在\n於真法之中也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喜覺分者\n謂若心得法喜善能覺了住真法喜也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除覺分者謂斷除諸見煩惱之時善能覺了不󰡷真正善根也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "定覺分者\n謂若發禪定時善能覺了不生妄想也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "捨覺分者謂若捨念著之境善能覺了虛偽永不追憶也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正見者謂修無漏行\n見四諦分明也漏盡者謂三界煩惱惑業斷盡不漏落生死也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正分別即正思惟謂\n見四諦時思惟籌量為令增長入涅槃故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正語者謂攝口業住\n於正語也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正業者謂除身\n一切邪業住於清淨正業也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正命者謂除邪命利養住於清淨正命也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正行即正精進謂身心專精勤求涅槃也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正念者謂念念在於正助之法\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正定者謂\n攝心正助之法入於正定也梵語三昧華言正定"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語菩提華言道三寶者佛寶法寶僧寶也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "檀梵語具云檀\n那華言布施"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禪梵\n語具云禪那華言靜慮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四攝法者一布施攝二愛語攝\n三利行攝四同事攝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十力\n者知是處非處智力知過現未來業報智力知諸禪三昧智力知諸根勝劣智力知\n種種解智力知種種界智力知一切至處道智力知天眼無礙智力知宿命無漏智\n力知永斷習氣智力也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼\n者謂知一切眾生各各方便所化之法門也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛眼者謂覆障雖密無不見知也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語陀羅尼華言總持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受記者謂菩薩受作佛之記也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從一地至一地智者謂從等覺菩薩之智至妙\n覺果佛之智也灌頂者謂等覺菩薩將入妙覺之位如轉輪王太子受王位時以四\n海水灌其頂也梵語阿耨多羅三藐三菩提華言無上正等正覺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出天台四教儀集註"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "好惡平三種不\n同者如色塵有好色有惡色其不好不惡之色名為平也聲香味觸法五塵亦然受\n即領納之義苦受對惡塵而起樂受對好塵而起不苦不樂受對平塵而起"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出因果經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語優樓頻螺迦葉華言木𤓰林梵語𨚗提迦葉華言河梵語伽耶迦葉華言\n城梵語舍利弗華言身子梵語大目犍連華言采菽氏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出華嚴孔目"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十使者使即驅役之義一貪二嗔三癡四慢五疑六身見七邊\n見八邪見九見取十戒取也多貪者謂於五欲可意之境而多貪愛也多嗔者謂於\n逆情之境而多忿怒也多癡者謂無所覺了而於貪嗔之境溺而不已也等分者謂\n貪嗔癡三心一齊而起也四大者地大水大火大風大也六衰者謂色聲香味觸法\n六塵能衰󰡷善法故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出賢刦經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "度無塵者謂事理行滿度生死流登\n涅槃岸無有窮極也三百五十度無極者光耀度無極世度無極為眾生故行度無\n極住度無極生死度無極所著度無極益他人度無極處所度無極道度無極慧度\n無極已修立行度無極逮得度無極念度無極離世度無極造有所作業度無極休\n息道度無極不置速度無極應順度無極造作度無極無作度無極意度無極勤修\n\n度無極正真度無極行捷疾度無極深奧度無極雜度無極清淨度無極無際度無\n極信道度無極為眾生厄故行度無極法故度無極寂樂度無極樂觀寂度無極一\n切所入度無極說處度無極無害度無極無敗度無極貧度無極不迴還度無極廻\n轉度無極嚴淨度無極堅強度無極興盛度無極充滿度無極為世度無極度世度\n無極無上度無極不亂度無極無怨度無極怨敵度無極攝持度無極無所攝持度\n無極報應度無極無報度無極自然度無極無所有度無極廣普度無極華度無極\n無量度無極慕求度無極所厭度無極妙樂度無極無樂度無極樂聞持度無極生\n死長度無極無斷度無極樂純淑度無極禪度無極神通度無極世巧便度無極慈\n愍護度無極行哀度無極歡喜度無極勸護度無極勸邪見度無極勸正見度無極\n勸住見度無極勸無住度無極勸無侍度無極勸意度無極勸忍度無極造業度無\n\n極無所造業度無極有餘度無極無餘度無極佛興盛度無極明度無極持住明度\n無極佛興成就度無極意不忽度無極佛興立在家度無極出家來度無極愍哀博\n聞來度無極出家不斷戒度無極住神通度無極神通意不斷度無極入欲度無極\n立度無極應進度無極眾報度無極無報度無極無樂度無極時進度無極光明度\n無極無量光度無極報安光度無極不廻還度無極娛樂度無極鮮潔度無極成世\n法度無極淨世度無極成種度無極來成眷屬度無極不壞眷屬度無極除塵來淨\n度無極觀土度無極宣誓度無極無放逸度無極周旋度無極滅度度無極豪貴度\n無極理眷屬度無極無所忘失度無極三十二相度無極順時度無極知時度無極\n分別度無極順世度無極邊際度無極蠲除度無極金剛度無極造救度無極自然\n度無極伏魔度無極無退度無極一時度無極無所著度無極三昧度無極訓誨度\n\n無極佛道度無極一切智度無極無餘度無極有餘度無極可止度無極諸佛度無\n極方便度無極愁慼度無極開化真陀度無極異度無極四意斷度無極四神足度\n無極四禪度無極四意止度無極四諦度無極信根精進根意根智慧根定根度無\n極信力精進力意力定力智慧力度無極七覺意度無極八品道行度無極寂然度\n無極所觀度無極樂明度無極來觧脫度無極比丘聖眾度無極八部會度無極歸\n觧度無極分別度無極別度度無極繫觧法度無極分別順理度無極辯才度無極\n無厭度無極六度度無極眼耳鼻舌身心度無極愍他勸助度無極愍己度無極法\n度無極宜度無極剖判度無極勸樂度無極三脫門度無極異行度無極觧他度無\n極勤用意度無極十種力度無極四無所畏度無極大哀度無極肉眼天眼慧眼法\n眼佛眼度無極自在度無極娛樂度無極難得自歸度無極十八不共諸佛之法度\n\n無極曉了方便度無極純淑度無極見自然度無極三界行度無極觀清白行度無\n極法種度無極八等度無極道跡徃來不還無著度無極緣覺度無極菩薩度無極\n盡慧度無極無所生慧度無極建立慧度無極致天眼天耳心智自在見過世事知\n他心念神足漏盡六通度無極威儀度無極愍傷度無極行空度無極捐拾度無極\n滅度度無極變化度無極流布法教度無極分舍利度無極然其中名有重出者乃\n經中所載之舊文也"}
